    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“He wasn’t just that.” The answer came more firmly than I expected. I stared at Beau. He looked toward the open barn doo",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15421
        },
        {
          "text": "“James expected the same things. The difference was, I wasn’t his kid. He didn’t have to.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15918
